findings.suggested_fix:
Before the remote verify:
- reject cheaply: `paypal-cert-url` host must be api.paypal.com or api.sandbox.paypal.com; `paypal-transmission-time` within ~10 minutes; `paypal-auth-algo` must be SHA256withRSA;
- apply a per-IP `check_rate_limit` (e.g. 60/min);
- optionally verify the RSA signature locally with a cached PayPal cert, as the PayPal SDKs do.

